    "title": "Use clauses as sentence constituents",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-subjects-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Use clauses as sentence constituents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "An action phrase can be the subject of a description. In 问清楚很重要, what is important is the activity of asking until things are clear; no extra word meaning it is needed. An adjective or a subject-predicate clause can itself be the subject. In a noun phrase, a possessor precedes demonstrative + number + classifier, then the descriptive modifier.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "问清楚很重要。",
                "pinyin": "wèn qīngchu hěn zhòngyào 。",
                "meaning": "Getting things clear by asking is important.",
                "audio": "fc36fcab304d904bcdfc5fde57b30f16196d48b07cf80c4d1b280ba87578f036"
              },
              {
                "text": "认真很重要。",
                "pinyin": "rènzhēn hěn zhòngyào 。",
                "meaning": "Being conscientious is important.",
                "audio": "606b086a6f06e044b3f5d03476bba4052af6c7a5fb9d61a8fb4ee6ebd17eb5e8"
              },
              {
                "text": "他能来很重要。",
                "pinyin": "tā néng lái hěn zhòngyào 。",
                "meaning": "It is important that he can come.",
                "audio": "fe13ff8ae1e3117091a9c904c81c5b977367e366016914670bfc36c63afbf850"
              },
              {
                "text": "我的这两本新书很有用。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ de zhè liǎng běn xīn shū hěn yǒuyòng 。",
                "meaning": "These two new books of mine are useful.",
                "audio": "639069e11b33c335b947c9e1fd9a7fe15fd004437caf17857e104cc7766719c4"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
